    "就怕一个浪头大来将渡船吞没。一轮火红的太阳正刚刚从东方升\n"
    "起。\n"
  );
  set("exits", ([ /* sizeof() == 2 */
    "north": "/d/jiangnan/river/northriver",
    "south": "/d/jiangnan/river/southriver",
  ]));

  setup();

